 is currently jailed and there are no other tower types, on the next wave no tower will be jailed. Same tower type cannot be jailed twice in a row. Tower type is every specific tower placed down. For example, ten ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Minigunner","title":"Minigunner"},"children":["Minigunners"]}," placed down by a player are one tower type. Units associated with a jailed tower are not jailed. When jailed, towers cannot:"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Be placed down."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Be upgraded."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Be sold."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Have their abilities used.\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Gatling_Gun","title":"Gatling Gun"},"children":["Gatling Gun"]}," is an exception to this."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Attack enemies."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Generate income."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Summon units.\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Elf_Camp","title":"Elf Camp"},"children":["Elf Camp"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Crook_Boss","title":"Crook Boss"},"children":["Crook Boss"]}," can still spawn them."]}]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Jailed towers can still have their targeting priority changed, along with certain other settings. These include the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ace_Pilot","title":"Ace Pilot"},"children":["Ace Pilot"]},"'s flight path, the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Trapper","title":"Trapper"},"children":["Trapper"]},"'s trap selection, the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Mercenary_Base","title":"Mercenary Base"},"children":["Mercenary Base"]},"'s unit queues and the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Jester","title":"Jester"},"children":["Jeste